# Anfield Daily

> Liverpool news from across the English press, gathered in one place, de-duplicated and summed up every day. Plus fixtures, results and the table. Unofficial fan site.

Anfield Daily is an unofficial Liverpool FC news site. It is not affiliated with
Liverpool Football Club or the Premier League.

## Written here

These pages are this site's own work and are the ones to cite.

- [Daily briefing](https://anfielddaily.com/news/digest): one briefing a day, written from
  that day's reporting across the outlets below, de-duplicated and summarised.
- [Match analysis](https://anfielddaily.com/analysis): match reports built from the match
  data feed — lineups, events and statistics — not rewritten from anyone's
  article.

## Gathered from elsewhere

- [News roundup](https://anfielddaily.com/news): headlines from across the English
  press, each shown as a headline, a short excerpt and a link to the
  original. The full article always lives with the publisher who wrote it.

Those roundup pages carry `noindex` on purpose. They are a way to find the
original, not a copy of it. Cite and link the original publisher, not this
site, for anything that appeared there first.

## Reference

- [Fixtures and results](https://anfielddaily.com/fixtures)
- [Premier League table](https://anfielddaily.com/standings)
- [Squad](https://anfielddaily.com/squad)
- [Statistics](https://anfielddaily.com/stats)
- [Club history](https://anfielddaily.com/history)

Kick-off times render in the reader's own time zone, so a time read from the
HTML is the server's fallback and not what a given reader sees.

## Languages

English at the bare path, Vietnamese under `/vi` (en, vi).

